        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-10-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="10" vertex="1" parent="step-10-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-10-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Runtime → Bedrock (Claude)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Inside the Runtime, ChatEngine calls &lt;i&gt;invoke_model_with_response_stream&lt;/i&gt; with a cached system prompt (schema brief) + tool schemas. Claude alternates text and tool_use blocks until end_turn.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-10-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Step 11 -->
        <mxCell id="step-11-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
